  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3702.02 Completing Form. All forms shall be:\n\n(a) Filled out completely;\n\n(b) Completed in a legible manner; and\n\n(c) Completed in a non-fading, no-erasable ink or type written.\n\nSource. #5485, eff 10-14-92; ss by #6855, INTERIM, eff 10-14-98, EXPIRES: 2-11-99; ss by #6890, eff 1-1-99; ss by #8665, eff 6-19-06, EXPIRED: 6-19-14\n\nNew. #11175, INTERIM, eff 9-15-16, EXPIRES: 3-14-17; ss by #12120, eff 2-23-17",
